@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: Reference / reusable template. Illustrative contract/model/pattern, not a product release commitment.
title Template example — Optional corruption detection and isolated recovery
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

start
:Detect integrity mismatch / unusable referenced data;
:Stop affected unsafe reads/writes; preserve evidence;
:Scope records, bytes, repositories and keys involved;
if (Usable authorized recovery source established?) then (yes)
 :Restore into isolated scoped environment;
 :Validate identities, references, keys, integrity and current authority;
 if (Usable consistent result verified?) then (yes)
  :Review cutover / reconciliation of unresolved effects;
  :Resume only permitted safe capability;
 else (no)
  :Retain failed recovery evidence; continue intervention;
 endif
else (no)
 :Record blocked recovery; no fabricated restoration;
endif
stop

@enduml
